      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white leading-tight">
        Hiten<br />
        <span class="text-[#1668d4]">Sharma</span>
      </h1>

      <div class="mt-4 h-8 flex items-center">
        <span class="font-mono text-lg text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
          &gt;&nbsp;<span id="role-display" class="text-[#1668d4] dark:text-[#6aa6fb] font-medium"></span>
        </span>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-6 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-lg max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
        I design and build <span class="font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">Java</span> backend systems that move real money and real ad spend — Spring Boot micro-services, batch pipelines, and APIs where correctness and latency aren't negotiable. 7 years across FinTech and AdTech.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a
          href="/HitenSharma_Resume.pdf"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="px-6 py-3 bg-[#1668d4] text-white rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-blue-600 transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/20"
        >
          Download Resume
